report-summary = Summary
report-the-changes = The changes
report-what-was-compared = What was compared
report-run-cmd-on-a-file-to-confirm-it-is-the-file-this-report = Run {cmd} on a file to confirm it is the file this report describes. This does not prove the report itself is unaltered.
only-on-the-left-empty-folder = Only on the left (empty folder)
only-on-the-right-empty-folder = Only on the right (empty folder)
identical = Identical
